  "_comment": "verified_on_hardware (boolean) decides the release stream: true goes to the normal release <tag>, false to the pre-release <tag>-preview. Set it to true only after someone has booted that board/variant; verified_note is only a hardware description (board revision and carrier), never a name or a date."
